                        <tr>
                           <td>HIV-1 RNA viral load is detectable at 22,833 copies/mL, indicating active HIV replication. This result confirms ongoing infection and may be used to assess disease progression or response to therapy. Clinical correlation and follow-up with CD4 count and antiretroviral treatment evaluation are recommended.</td>
